"During their investigation of Raka, Mehul and Anand find Solanki and her son. When the duo visit her house, they learn a disturbing truth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/29OFzTXTdLWlDVM3Br1IHWqr6CW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9aaWRkaSUyMElzaHElMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"A Stranger","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Sidharth's attention towards Mehul increases, Mousumi finally agrees to talk to her about Shekhar. Mehul gets another anonymous message, asking her to return to Darjeeling.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9MzjQZscQcO30wlT6ABVifCpp7E.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9aaWRkaSUyMElzaHElMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Beautiful Valleys","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mehul reaches Darjeeling and finds the person she is looking for. Mousumi and Anand, searching for Mehul, meet Solanki.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5D5XsHn84op0jvc9UsSkl858sCm.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9aaWRkaSUyMElzaHElMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"The Final Path","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sidharth invites Mehul to a party, promising to introduce her to his family. However, she confronts him, accusing him of being responsible for Shekhar's death.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uaXjT83KhiMIkosejDsI5w7UuDK.jpg"}]}}